msgstr ""
"When the error is reported and the complete ID of the candidate has been "
"listed - follow the prompts to change it and don't guess again."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:186
msgid "**书写符号（三套，不要混）**"
msgstr "**Writing symbols (three sets, don’t mix)**"

