msgstr ""
"Use a hyphen to extract a certain target into Reference: `close-000300.SH`;"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:190
msgid "完整 id 用下划线连接资产类型与频率：`close_E_d`。"
msgstr ""
"The full id connects the asset type and frequency with an underscore: "
"`close_E_d`."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:192
msgid "请不要写 `wt_id:000300.SH` 这种冒号语法。"
msgstr "Please do not write colon syntax like `wt_id:000300.SH`."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:194
msgid ""
"常见取值备忘：`freq` 如 `d` / `w` / `m` / `q` / `1min`，`None` 表示与频率无关（多为 "
"Static）；`asset_type` 如 `E` 股票、`IDX` 指数、`FD` 基金、`FT` 期货、`OPT` 期权。"
msgstr ""
"Common value memos: `freq` such as `d` / `w` / `m` / `q` / `1min`, `None` "
"means independent of frequency (mostly Static); `asset_type` such as `E` "
"Stocks, `IDX` Indexes, `FD` Funds, `FT` Futures, `OPT` Options."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:198
msgid "如何找到需要的 ID"
msgstr "How to find the required ID"

