"still be arranged according to internal acquisition methods, subject to the "
"description on the list page)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:218
msgid "交互环境中也可以拉完整映射表："
msgstr ""
"The complete mapping table can also be pulled in the interactive "
"environment:"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:228
msgid ""
"清单由 `docs/scripts/generate_datatype_catalog.py` "
