#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:305
msgid ""
"**可用性**：完整清单会保留全部内置类型，其中一部分今天没有一等用法（目录里看得到，但没有推荐入口）。例如大宗交易买方营业部 "
"`block_trade_buyer` 虽是 History 形状，但格子是文本，无法编入只吃数值的 HistoryPanel / 策略窗口，清单会标 "
"`usable_in=none`；研究时请直接读底层表（如 "
"`DataSource.read_table_data('block_trade')`）。检索结果请按描述与入口提示选用，不要一律 "
"`get_history_data`。"
msgstr ""
"**Availability**: The complete list will retain all built-in types, some of "
"which have no first-class usage today (can be seen in the directory, but "
"there is no recommended entry). For example, the bulk trading buyer's "
"business department `block_trade_buyer` is in the shape of History, but the "
"grid is text and cannot be compiled into the HistoryPanel/strategy window, "
"which only takes numerical values. The list is marked `usable_in=none`; when"
" researching, please read the underlying table directly (such as "
"`DataSource.read_table_data('block_trade')`). Please select the search "
"results according to the description and entrance prompts, do not use "
"`get_history_data`."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:306
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**下载与表结构**：本地没有表，任何 ID 都取不出数。下载与表结构见 [DataSource](03.%20datasource.md) 与 "
"[数据表章节](04.%20data_tables_10.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Download and table structure**: There is no local table, and no number can"
" be obtained from any ID. For download and table structure, see "
"[DataSource](03.%20datasource.md) and [Data Table "
"Chapter](04.%20data_tables_10.md)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:307
msgid ""
"**过程数据**：`proc.*`（持仓、现金等回测/实盘过程量）不是本目录里的 DataType，见设计文档 "
"[过程数据与动态回测](../design/09-process-data-and-dynamic-backtest.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Process data**: `proc.*` (position, cash, etc. backtest/real offer process"
" volume) is not DataType in this directory, see the design document [Process"
" Data and Dynamic Backtest] (../design/09-process-data-and-dynamic-"
"backtest.md)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:308
msgid ""
"**内部获取方式**：映射表里还有 "
"`acquisition_type`（直读、复权、事件等），那是框架从表里怎么抽出信息的内部算法，**不是**用户分类，选类型时不必填写。排障时可以在清单靠后列对照"
" `table_name`。"
msgstr ""
"**Internal acquisition method**: There is also `acquisition_type` (direct "
"reading, right restoration, event, etc.) in the mapping table. It is the "
"internal algorithm of how the framework extracts information from the table."
" It is not user classification and does not need to be filled in when "
"selecting the type. When troubleshooting, you can check `table_name` at the "
"end of the list."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:309
msgid ""
"**自定义类型**：面向用户的稳定注册入口尚未交付。需要尚未内置的复合指标时，先取出原子字段，再在 `HistoryPanel.assign` 或策略 "
"`realize()` 中计算（教程见 [玩数据与因子分析](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-"
"analysis.md)）。"
msgstr ""
"**Custom type**: The stable registration portal for users has not yet been "
"delivered. When you need a composite indicator that is not yet built-in, "
"first take out the atomic field and then calculate it in "
"`HistoryPanel.assign` or strategy `realize()` (for tutorials, see [Playing "
"with Data and Factor Analysis](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-"
"analysis.md))."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:310
msgid ""
"**专家层对象**：排查单一类型或编写更底层脚本时，仍可构造 `DataType` 并调用 "
"`get_data_from_source`。这不是日常路径，签名见 [DataType API](../api/data_types.rst)。"
msgstr ""
"**Expert Layer Object**: When troubleshooting a single type or writing "
"lower-level scripts, you can still construct `DataType` and call "
"`get_data_from_source`. This is not a daily path, the signature is in "
"[DataType API](../api/data_types.rst)."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:314
msgid "小结与下一步"
msgstr "Summary and next steps"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:316
msgid "读到这里，您应已掌握："
msgstr "After reading this, you should have mastered:"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:318
msgid "DataType 是**信息 ID**，不是表列名，也不是下载器；您日常写字符串。"
msgstr ""
"DataType is the **information ID**, not the table column name, nor the "
"downloader; you write strings every day."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:319
msgid "三种形状对应三种用法：History 进面板/策略窗，Reference 是与池子无关的时间序列，Static 是截面属性。"
msgstr ""
"The three shapes correspond to three usages: History enters the "
"panel/strategy window, Reference is a time series unrelated to the pool, and"
" Static is a cross-sectional attribute."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:320
