"`get_reference_data`、属性与股票池 `get_static_data`。"
msgstr ""
"Select the entry by task: Strategy `get_data`, Research `get_kline` / "
"`get_history_data`, Macro and Benchmark `get_reference_data`, Properties and"
" Stock Pool `get_static_data`."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:321
msgid "研究可用宽名；策略与消歧时写完整 id（`close_E_d`）。"
msgstr ""
"Use wide names for research; write the full id (`close_E_d`) for strategy "
"and disambiguation."

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:323
msgid "**下一步阅读**："
msgstr "**Read next**:"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:325
#, python-format
msgid ""
"把多标的、多指标收拢到同一时间轴：[HistoryPanel](02.5.%20historypanel.md)，可视化见 [HistoryPanel "
"可视化](02.6.%20historypanel_visual.md)；"
msgstr ""
"Collate multiple targets and indicators into the same timeline: "
"[HistoryPanel](02.5.%20historypanel.md). For visualization, see "
"[HistoryPanel Visualization](02.6.%20historypanel_visual.md);"

#: ../../source/manage_data/02. datatypes.md:326
